msgctxt "300"
msgid "Let's enjoy the rest of our vacation together... big brother!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid "Haha! I can't help but blush when you put it like that!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid "Well... I guess there was nothing to worry about after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid "Yeah, I guess not..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid "You got 10,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid "Hey, did ya see that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "444"
msgid "Yeah... I hope they're alright."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "456"
msgid "Shouldn't we help them before it gets out of hand?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid "Uncle Kaz, look!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "480"
msgid "Don't tell me..."
msgstr "[Non dirmi...]"

msgctxt "504"
msgid "It's them!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "516"
msgid "I should have known it'd end up like this again..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "576"
msgid "Mizuki-chan! I knew you were lying to me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "588"
msgid "Wait, Akimoto-kun! You have to believe me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "600"
msgid "Nuh-uh, not this time! I'm not falling for this again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "612"
msgid "Hey, cut it out!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "624"
msgid "Yeah! Let's all take a deep breath and talk it out!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "636"
msgid "No! I finally see what's going on here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "648"
msgid "Mizuki-chan has been swindling me from the very start!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "660"
msgid "Hold on. Didn't you just get engaged?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "672"
msgid ""
"Yeah! Just as I'd thought it was finally time to make Mizuki-chan my one and"
" only..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "684"
msgid ""
"*sob* I realized she was only ever after my money! She was never planning to"
" marry me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "696"
msgid "You've got it all wrong, Akimoto-kun!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "708"
msgid "Do you have any proof?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "720"
msgid ""
"Yeah. The first time I thought something was wrong was when we were flying "
"down here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "732"
msgid ""
"I went out of my way to buy expensive tickets for us, but Mizuki-chan "
"canceled her ticket and bought a cheap one instead!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "744"
msgid ""
"Because of that, I had to sit next to this smelly old lady the whole way to "
"Okinawa!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "756"
msgid "I, uh..."
msgstr "Io, uhm..."

msgctxt "768"
msgid ""
"You got the ticket reimbursed and took the leftover cash for yourself, "
"didn't you!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "780"
msgid "There's a reason I did that... I swear!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "792"
msgid ""
"She probably wanted to help the old lady you ended up sitting next to. Is "
"that why you gave up your seat, Mizuki?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "804"
msgid ""
"Yeah! She had terrible back problems, so I gave her my much more comfortable"
" seat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "816"
msgid "Really...?"
msgstr "Davvero...?"

msgctxt "828"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, Akimoto-kun. I know you went out of your way to buy me that "
"expensive ticket..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "840"
msgid "It's totally fine! You're such a kind person, Mizuki-chan!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "852"
msgid "Do you trust me now, Akimoto-kun?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "864"
msgid "Well... Well, no! That wasn't the only thing! There's still more!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "876"
msgid "She probably just wasn't feeling well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "888"
msgid ""
"It's true... I wasn't feeling well at all. I figured sitting by the window "
"would let me get some fresh air, clear my head."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "900"
msgid "Oh... I guess that makes sense."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "912"
msgid "Hold on, airplane windows don't open!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "924"
msgid "Well, um! This one did! You have to believe me, Akimoto-kun!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "936"
msgid "Fine... But there's still more!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "960"
msgid "Like the hotel! Why did we have to get separate rooms?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "972"
msgid "Well... the truth is, my mom found out we were going on this trip."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "984"
msgid ""
"She said she didn't want me to sleep in the same room as you until we got "
"married."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "996"
msgid ""
"I see what you were after, Akimoto. There's only one reason why you'd want "
"to share a hotel room."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1008"
msgid "Huh? What are you implying!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1020"
msgid ""
"I was just... I just wanted to be with Mizuki-chan so I could watch over "
"her! I always worry about her!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1032"
msgid ""
"Akimoto-kun, this was supposed to be a fun, relaxing vacation. I can't "
"believe you have such a dirty mind..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1044"
msgid ""
"No, you've got it all wrong, Mizuki-chan! Dammit, this is all your fault! "
"Why'd you have to go and say that!? Besides, I still can't trust you, "
"Mizuki-chan!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1068"
msgid "She probably couldn't say no to her mom."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1080"
msgid ""
"That's right. I thought that if my mom got mad, she might completely change "
"her mind about our marriage, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1092"
msgid "Right... I guess it's good for me to stay on your mom's good side."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1104"
msgid "That's right, Akimoto-kun."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1116"
msgid "Still, I'm having a really hard time trusting you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1128"
msgid "I mean, we're engaged... But you don't ever wear your ring! Why not?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1140"
msgid "Well, the truth is... I don't actually like diamonds."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1152"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr "Cosa!?"

msgctxt "1164"
msgid ""
"I watched a documentary about people in foreign countries who die in the "
"horrific conditions of diamond mines... I couldn't bear to wear a diamond "
"after that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1176"
msgid ""
"That's an honorable thing for Mizuki to do. You should try to understand "
"where she's coming from."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1188"
msgid ""
"I just couldn't get the image of those poor, suffering people out of my "
"head... So I couldn't wear it, I'm sorry!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1200"
msgid ""
"I'm so sorry. I wish I'd known... Still, maybe you could just wear it for me"
" every now and then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1212"
msgid ""
"Huh? But I already pawned⑬ I mean... I'll put it on for you once we get back"
" to Tokyo!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1224"
msgid "You should get her a new ring."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1236"
msgid ""
"What!? But that diamond ring cost nearly an entire year's salary! There's no"
" way I could get another ring like that!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1248"
msgid "I'm sorry, Akimoto-kun! Just try to understand!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1272"
msgid ""
"Hold on, I'm not done! What about those documents we signed when we got "
"engaged!? What were those about, huh!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1284"
msgid "She made you sign documents?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1296"
msgid "Yeah, it was a contract for life insurance!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1308"
msgid "I was just worried that if something happened to you, I'd..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1320"
msgid ""
"Why are you the beneficiary on the contract when we're not even married "
"yet!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1332"
msgid ""
"Because it's my job to handle the family finances! I'm just getting ready "
"for our future together!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1344"
msgid "Mizuki's going to make a great wife."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1356"
msgid ""
"I see! I never knew Mizuki-chan was thinking so carefully about our future!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1368"
msgid "Akimoto-kun! I'm so glad you understand!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1380"
msgid "This way, even if you die, everything will be okay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1392"
msgid "Right! Even if something happens to you, it'll all work out!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1404"
msgid "Oh, wow! So I don't have to worry about what might happen!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1416"
msgid "...Wait, hold on! I'm not going to let you swindle me again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1428"
msgid "Akimoto-kun!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1452"
msgid ""
"Mizuki-chan... What about our baby? Remember when you told me you were "
"pregnant?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1464"
msgid "When is the baby due? It's been two years!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1476"
msgid "Well... It turns out I was wrong. I wasn't actually pregnant."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1488"
msgid "False pregnancies happen all the time. You can't blame her for that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1500"
msgid ""
"What are you talking about!? I already bought a whole bunch of baby "
"supplies, thinking it'd be born any day!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1512"
msgid ""
"I even asked my relatives for names! All that effort was for nothing, and "
"it's all your fault!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1536"
msgid ""
"Mizuki must really want kids with you, Akimoto. She probably thought if she "
"pretended for long enough, maybe someday it would actually happen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1548"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry... I was afraid to tell you it wasn't a real pregnancy. I didn't "
"want you to be upset."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1560"
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr "Oh..."

msgctxt "1572"
msgid "But don't be sad, Akimoto-kun!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1584"
msgid "Mizuki-chan... There's one more thing I have to ask you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1596"
msgid "What is it, Akimoto-kun?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1608"
msgid "...Do you really love me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1620"
msgid "What are you saying? Of course I do, Akimoto-kun!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1632"
msgid "Then let's get married! Right here, right now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1644"
msgid "I'm sorry, Akimoto-kun. I... can't do that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1656"
msgid "But why? Were you just using me after all!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1680"
msgid "She probably wanted to help the old lady."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1692"
msgid "She probably wasn't feeling well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1704"
msgid "Hoping for some action, Akimoto?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1716"
msgid "She probably couldn't say no to her mom."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1728"
msgid "That's honorable of her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1740"
msgid "You should get her a new ring."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1752"
msgid "She's going to be a great wife."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1764"
msgid "Even if you die, it'll all be okay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1776"
msgid "False pregnancies happen all the time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1788"
msgid "She must really want kids with you."
msgstr ""

